# Bulk data — not code. Exclude from Cursor indexing and agent context.
# When a task needs a number from these, run a committed script; never read
# records into context.
#
# Scoped to the record trees only. corpora/_ops/ is CONFIGURATION — model tiers,
# token limits, budget caps — and excluding it cost an agent the ability to name
# the model it was about to spend against. Configuration is read directly.

corpora/evidence/
corpora/extraction/
analysis/

